Output matches what you need. The key piece is:

```csharp
var options = new JsonSerializerOptions { PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonNamingPolicy.CamelCase };
JsonSerializer.Serialize(person, options);
```

`JsonNamingPolicy.CamelCase` (built into `System.Text.Json`) converts `Name` → `name` and `Age` → `age` automatically — no extra NuGet packages required.
